                    104.0,
                    246.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Upon return from a Personal Leave of Absence the employee shall be reinstated to his or her former Job Classification and Division, in accordance with his or her relative seniority and in accordance with the Federal Family Leave Act where applicable.",
            "block_bbox": [
                103,
